OL,3,GNEWSAJail warning for care staff who
OL,4,Amistreated resident
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour members of staff who have admitted
OL,7,Fmistreating a resident in a care home
OL,8,Fhave been warned by a judge they face
OL,9,Fjail.
OL,11,FThe 28-year-old resident at Broughton
OL,12,FHouse and College, near Lincoln, was
OL,13,Ftaken to hospital with non-serious
OL,14,Finjuries, Lincolnshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe home in Brant Broughton specialises
OL,17,Fin looking after adults with autism and
OL,18,Fthose with learning disabilities.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
