OL,3,GNEWSAJail warning for care staff who
OL,4,Amistreated resident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIbukun Abati-Sobulo, 40, pleaded guilty
OL,7,Fat Lincoln Crown Court on Monday to two
OL,8,Fcounts of ill-treating or wilfully
OL,9,Fneglecting an individual between 16 May
OL,10,Fand 2 July. He appeared alongside three
OL,11,Fother men who had previously admitted
OL,12,Foffences.
